# NOTE: Git LFS is intentionally NOT used here.
#
# The upstream Isaac Lab template tracked *.usd / *.usda (and other binaries) with LFS. The hand
# assets in 'asset/' total only ~13 MB, and the rest of this repository uses no LFS at all, so
# requiring git-lfs would only mean that anyone cloning without it ends up with pointer files
# instead of usable USD. Keep new binaries as plain files unless they get genuinely large.

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
